; DWIN display on-device test: an "air print" for pause / resume / cancel.
; No heating and no extrusion; after homing the nozzle stays 30 mm above the bed and
; moves inside X/Y 60..160 mm. Takes about 5 minutes.
; Copy to ~/printer_data/gcodes/ and start it from the display (Print menu).
